Cross-references:
- AGENTS.md standing rule: 'Estimate RAM load for every dispatched workload; bin systems by capacity (Will, 2026-11-21)'; MEMORY.md: 'RAM-load estimation for dispatched workloads (Will, 2026-11-21 20:25 CST, standing rule)'
