- ~/memory/2026-11-17.md: the ruling sequence 20:58-21:02 CST (task 41.6.11/9.7.14/7.6.11) and 'Phext-native OS census - DELIVERED' (~21:27 CST; ~/workspace/phext-os/census/CENSUS.md)
